{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3287bbf496ddeb6165e65dde74cc6d3803d4da45065638f22e0ad8fa9179eb88", "ja": "（エレナの新しい衣装は、かなり評判がいいみたいだ。\n本人の反応はどうかな……）", "zh": "（艾琳娜的新服装似乎颇受好评。\n至于她本人的反应又是如何呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0084_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "c90671080d2199292eb8890f84571b09c71045253681d7720037e419ec870e55", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！　おはよー！\nねーねー、ハグしよっ♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！早安──！\n欸欸～来抱抱吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0084_1002_p", "source_sha256": "44cae260c08fc69946801ad8c4c42c3cc79d9eb3fcd02baf4adeed9648973951", "ja": "おはよう、エレナ……って、ストップ！\nなんで、いきなりハグなんだ？", "zh": "早，艾琳娜……等等、Stop！\n为什么突然要抱抱？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0084_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "f1c33d1537d1cd138b813bd19413440165e92553dd55c9340924a091143b5b87", "ja": "え？　えっとー。この衣装を着ると、\nすごくハッピーな気持ちになるからだヨ♪", "zh": "咦？我想想～因为穿上这套服装，\n就感觉非常幸福喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0084_1004_p", "source_sha256": "06fd7adc6a942804fade8efbd1ccf9d1bec102da8e6e760e8a84602df98851ec", "ja": "そうか。……喜ぶのはいいけど、その度に\n誰かに抱き着いてたら、衣装がぐしゃぐしゃになるぞ？", "zh": "这样啊……你高兴是无妨，但每次都这样\n抱人的话，服装会变得皱巴巴的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0084_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "5a6075b542ee3cb547fa8c89e1e01eaf0c32e7423c036ffce3bb3414662d29a9", "ja": "エーッ！？\nそっかー。じゃあ、ガマンする……。", "zh": "咦──！？\n对耶～那人家忍忍……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0084_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4be8247d0c6f992784b734c4b6324e4b407c388cebd46724b5382f8aad3cf6a6", "ja": "よし、偉いぞ。\nけどエレナ、そんなに気に入ったんだな、その衣装。", "zh": "好，你真棒。\n不过艾琳娜，原来你这么喜欢那套服装啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0084_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "afa00c675c48a4de7c97f133df6d7452614110c762ce73ac12f87b4b4b9e5ac1", "ja": "ウン！　すっごく気に入ってるヨ♪\nカワイイでしょ、それにカッコイイし……。", "zh": "嗯！我超喜欢的喔♪\n很可爱不是吗？而且又很帅……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0084_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "345f5a0f4e8edee0b704f11c87573e644cc848143c815bb737694b4cf8119799", "ja": "この衣装を着ると、海賊船に乗りたくなっちゃうネ♪\nみんなと大きな船に乗れて、楽しかったナー。", "zh": "穿上这套服装，就想去搭海盗船了呢♪\n跟大家一起搭上大船的时候，真的好好玩～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0084_1009_p", "source_sha256": "5fec6184a5899aceb7dfca88e220430b4d30b8938e8c3750883f77ed33781423", "ja": "確かに、大きな船の上での撮影なんて\n滅多にない体験だったもんな。", "zh": "说得也是，在大船上拍戏\n可是难得的体验呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0084_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "34f338efe65652851f7c733e339e7596c10fe9bb9c047b3d336cbc1f66522ab8", "ja": "そうなノ！　でも海賊の人たちは、船の上で\nずっと一緒に生活しながら、旅をするんでしょ？", "zh": "没错！不过海盗都是一直过着海上生活，\n一起旅行的不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0084_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "f683053d1b68a02666298111ad0d9212d9c1fefa467fcff37a146df3458508c5", "ja": "ワタシたちは撮影の間だけだったけど。何をするのも\nみんなと一緒で、本物の家族みたいだナって思ったヨ♪", "zh": "虽然只有在拍戏的期间，但我们不管做什么\n都是大家一起，感觉就像真正的家人一样呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0084_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "d508c5530fe66e9c89f7b18bf65c05f0290f3cfeeea7f1f1a61faa8c61359544", "ja": "キャプテンのマコトがパパンで、チハヤがママンかナ？\nタカネがお姉さんで、シホとイクは妹だヨ～！", "zh": "演船长的真是爸爸，千早是妈妈吧？\n贵音是姊姊，志保和育是妹妹喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0084_1013_p", "source_sha256": "87248b7954b98728be64cf1d49f9d6602bc4d3bd02a78cc9dae894d8b936d7ad", "ja": "ははっ。船が海賊達のホーム、って事か。\n……うん、言われてみればそうなのかもしれない。", "zh": "哈哈，船只就是海盗们的家，是吧？\n……嗯，听你这么一说好像真的是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0084_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "9a8480d1e770802d76b5da780d6cde3a805af2e00c9540692c75e1317e43682d", "ja": "お天気をみるワタシは、海賊船がホームだけど……\nアイドルのワタシのホームは、劇場だヨ♪", "zh": "观测天候的我是以海盗船为家……\n而身为偶像的我，就是以剧场为家喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0084_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "4a7efacd349a4c7f65a1d975f6ddf8b7d1a4e870606fd25b0595c9aafcdc4e83", "ja": "あ、そうだ！　劇場のお客さんたちも、ワタシたちの\n家族になっちゃえばいいんだヨ！　きっと楽しいヨ♪", "zh": "啊，对了！让剧场的观众们\n也成为我们的家人就好了！一定会很有趣♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0084_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e2632cf9997c91243b3125cee2d77cf6aa00f50a14b28064ec17a84d2a7f86be", "ja": "なるほど、お客さんもみんな家族か……。\nエレナらしい考え方だな。", "zh": "原来如此，跟观众们也成为一家人……\n这思维很有艾琳娜的风格呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0084_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "e4cdac6f48a37f16db42aa4ba77993796e95cb32f1134d3321293c7c3205cce3", "ja": "エヘヘ♪　{$P$}、ワタシ、\nもっともっと、たくさん仕事がしたいナ～。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪{$P$}，我呀，\n想要做更多更多的工作～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0084_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "e81ae138e96348b256d502bd2db7c6d63f3569042bea5c1b31ba6e962ae66b3c", "ja": "歌もダンスも、いっぱいレッスンするヨ。\nエレナのホームに、ファミリーを増やしたいからネ♪", "zh": "唱歌跟跳舞艾琳娜都会努力练习。\n因为艾琳娜想让自己的家人变得越来越多♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0084_1019_p", "source_sha256": "c8ff559148d9a012273fb7686d371de47e97900b0a686150eb34a973a7207af0", "ja": "うん、エレナの気持ちはわかった。\nファミリーが増えるように、頑張っていこうな！", "zh": "嗯，我明白艾琳娜的想法了。\n我们一起加油，让家人变多吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0084_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "273348e469b3fc98f82ffecf87b1ca24e1c959a30b7a2e56d8be830cd61d5253", "ja": "ハーイ♪　エヘヘ……{$P$}って、\nなんか本物の航海士みたいだネ？", "zh": "好～♪嘿嘿……感觉{$P$}，\n真的就像航海士一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0084_1021_018ele", "source_sha256": "66cbed1e82971daa593a406d84434be74ca5154ef6310e071c2534ac6a013ba1", "ja": "ワタシが「あっちに行きたい！」って言うと、\nちゃんと連れてってくれるし……。", "zh": "只要我说「想去那里！」，\n你就会确实把我带到那……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0084_1022_p", "source_sha256": "04ab36389eb46ce48d2c87eabe1e72dad278404a605ba5456adc36c24a3729ae", "ja": "そうか？　でも、今回の航海士はエレナだと思うよ。\n自分の行きたい場所がわかってるんだからな。", "zh": "是吗？不过，我觉得这次艾琳娜才是航海士。\n因为你知道自己想抵达的目的地。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0084_1023_018ele", "source_sha256": "fb9e64669dca294f587ce4640e41543db20eebd120662956856530ccf9da4bb2", "ja": "エヘヘ、そうかナ？　じゃあ迷子にならないように、\n{$P$}はワタシについてきてネ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，是吗？那{$P$}\n要好好跟着我，不要迷路了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0084_1024_018ele", "source_sha256": "0d432df73f501f0cd0c1856b8e28d0689fcded673ca0fdfb4d5460edd2947034", "ja": "出発、しんこ～う！", "zh": "出发、前进～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
